  {
   "id": 1156275,
   "title": "Changing the printer edition",
   "updated": "2026-08-18 08:16:32",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "After completing the CORE One+ (Gen 2) upgrade, <strong>change the printer edition to CORE One+ (Gen 2)</strong>.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "reminder",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "This is required because the Gen 2 uses belts and pulleys with a different tooth pitch.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Go to <em><strong>Settings → Hardware → Edition</strong></em> and select <strong>CORE One+ Gen2</strong>.",
     "color": "violet",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The printer will ask you to confirm the edition change. Select <em><strong>Yes</strong></em>.",
     "color": "light_blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
